{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"二年春，公會戎于潛。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"夏五月，莒人入向。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"無駭帥師入極。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"秋八月庚辰，公及戎盟于唐。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"九月，紀裂繻來逆女。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"冬十月，伯姬歸于紀。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"紀子帛、莒子盟于密。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"十有二月乙卯，夫人子氏薨。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"鄭人伐衛。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"二年春，公會戎于潛，修惠公之好也。戎請盟，公辭。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"莒子娶于向，向姜不安莒而歸。夏，莒人入向，以姜氏還。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"司空無駭入極，費庈父勝之。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"戎請盟。秋，盟于唐，復修戎好也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"九月，紀裂繻來逆女，卿為君逆也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"冬，紀子帛、莒子盟于密，魯故也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_2_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_2","textTraditional":"鄭人伐衛，討公孫滑之亂也。","sentenceOrder":18}],"overrides":{}}